\f0\fs34 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 How could I take information like the following, combined with homeowner parcel info and what we learned in this video, to create a 3D image of a home:\cb1 \
\
\cb3 High-resolution LiDAR elevation data and parcel-level scans for Salt Lake City neighborhoods are primarily managed by the state. You can access public bare-earth digital elevation models (DEMs) and point clouds through the Utah Geospatial Resource Center or download specific geographic tiles directly via the UGRC Raster Data Discovery portal.\cb1 \
