\f0\fs34 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 I misspoke. We are using a Jumpstart Rails Pro, Rails 8 app to collect and present the data. We see the possibility of working with two sets of data. The first set is any data that supports the creation of a digital twin of a home parcel. The second set is any data about an ADU to be installed on that parcel.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
